+llama: rank with nvidia/llama-nemotron-rerank-1b-v2 (LlamaBidirectionalForSequenceClassification)
+
+Ported from ggml-org/llama.cpp#24083 (open) onto ddf48f8. The model is Llama 3.2
+1B with bidirectional attention: the last hidden states mean-pooled, then
+`score` (hidden -> 1, no bias), a raw logit; its prompt is
+"question:{query} \n \n passage:{document}" and its tokenizer adds BOS.
+
+- conversion: LlamaBidirectionalForSequenceClassification on the llama-embed
+  class; causal attention off; pooling RANK with classifier pooling MEAN (this
+  base already pools before the head when the GGUF says so: the ModernBERT gte
+  path, so no graph change, where #24083 adds an arch check); the rerank
+  template; score.weight -> cls.output.weight; the tokenizer read with
+  trust_remote_code.
+- llama-embed: loads the optional cls.output head.
+- server: a rerank template's prompt gets BOS when the vocab adds it, as the
+  model's own tokenizer does.
+
